@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam ArrowColor #7F5539
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.2
skinparam rectangle {
  RoundCorner 16
  BorderColor #7F5539
  FontColor #1F2933
}
left to right direction

rectangle "mfd_window" as Host #FFE3E3
rectangle "LoadLibrary(plugin.dll)" as Loader #FFF3D6
rectangle "MfdGetWindowFramebufferPluginApi" as Entry #FFF7B3
rectangle "MfdWindowFramebufferPluginApi\nstruct_size\ninfo\nplugin_context\ninit\nsubmit_frame\nclose\ndestroy" as ApiTable #D9EDFF
rectangle "Plugin context\nplugin-owned allocation" as Context #F3E8FF
rectangle "submit_frame(frame)\nwidth\nheight\npixels\npixel_bytes\nrow_stride_bytes\npixel_format=Rgba32" as Submit #E9F5DB

Host --> Loader : load the DLL
Loader --> Entry : search the exported symbol
Entry --> ApiTable : fill the ABI table
ApiTable --> Context : hold plugin state
Host --> ApiTable : init(...)
Host --> Submit : submit_frame(...) on each frame
Host --> ApiTable : close() at loop shutdown
Host --> ApiTable : destroy() on unload

note bottom of ApiTable
The ABI stays stable and C-only:
no STL, no exceptions,
no shared graphics objects.
end note
@enduml
